      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dragonwhelp exhales sludge in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 12 Dexterity saving throw, taking 10 (3d6) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature that fails their saving throw by 5 or more must make a DC 15 Constitution save or contract the plague of undeath.</p>",
